{"id":"c-jinshu-070-ganzhuo:p006:m0487","surface":"竇融","start":487,"end":489,"person_id":"uoo_3lo_4z0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-070-ganzhuo:p006:m0561","surface":"竇融","start":561,"end":563,"person_id":"uoo_3lo_4z0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-070-ganzhuo:p006:m0610","surface":"劉隗","start":610,"end":612,"person_id":"hnd_3at_h4i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-070-ganzhuo:p006:m0777","surface":"王含","start":777,"end":779,"person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-070-ganzhuo:p006:m0840","surface":"呂蒙","start":840,"end":842,"person_id":"ibt_i7u_ykp","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-070-ganzhuo","book_id":"b-jinshu-070","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-070-ganzhuo-ws2595540"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p005","text":"　　燮體器寬厚，謙虛下士，中國士人往依避難者以百數。耽玩春秋，為之注解。陳國袁徽與尚書令荀彧書曰：「交阯士府君既學問優博，又達於從政，處大亂之中，保全一郡，二十餘年疆埸無事，民不失業，羇旅之徒，皆蒙其慶，雖竇融保河西，曷以加之？官事小闋，輒玩習書傳，春秋左氏傳尤簡練精微，吾數以咨問傳中諸疑，皆有師說，意思甚密。又尚書兼通古今，大義詳備。聞京師古今之學，是非忿爭，今欲條左氏、尚書長義上之。」其見稱如此。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":41,"last_line":41,"raw_start":5351,"raw_end":5553,"raw_character_offsets":[5351,5352,5353,5354,5355,5356,5357,5358,5359,5360,5361,5362,5363,5364,5365,5366,5367,5368,5369,5370,5371,5372,5373,5374,5375,5376,5377,5378,5379,5380,5381,5382,5383,5384,5385,5386,5387,5388,5389,5390,5391,5392,5393,5394,5395,5396,5397,5398,5399,5400,5401,5402,5403,5404,5405,5406,5407,5408,5409,5410,5411,5412,5413,5414,5415,5416,5417,5418,5419,5420,5421,5422,5423,5424,5425,5426,5427,5428,5429,5430,5431,5432,5433,5434,5435,5436,5437,5438,5439,5440,5441,5442,5443,5444,5445,5446,5447,5448,5449,5450,5451,5452,5453,5454,5455,5456,5457,5458,5459,5460,5461,5462,5463,5464,5465,5466,5467,5468,5469,5470,5471,5472,5473,5474,5475,5476,5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483,5484,5485,5486,5487,5488,5489,5490,5491,5492,5493,5494,5495,5496,5497,5498,5499,5500,5501,5502,5503,5504,5505,5506,5507,5508,5509,5510,5511,5512,5513,5514,5515,5516,5517,5518,5519,5520,5521,5522,5523,5524,5525,5526,5527,5528,5529,5530,5531,5532,5533,5534,5535,5536,5537,5538,5539,5540,5541,5542,5543,5544,5545,5546,5547,5548,5549,5550,5551,5552],"revision_id":2075209},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p005:m0002","surface":"燮","start":2,"end":3,"kind":"person","person_id":"p2p_gqb_6ar","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p005:m0038","surface":"袁徽","start":38,"end":40,"kind":"person","person_id":"sgw_8eg_ax6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p005:m0044","surface":"荀彧","start":44,"end":46,"kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p005:m0052","surface":"士府君","start":52,"end":55,"kind":"person","person_id":"p2p_gqb_6ar","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete:p005:m0103","surface":"竇融","start":103,"end":105,"kind":"person","person_id":"uoo_3lo_4z0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-049","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-049-shixie-complete-ws2075209"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018-pei01-02","text":"臣松之以为张昭劝迎曹公，所存岂不远乎？夫其扬休正色，委质孙氏，诚以厄运初遘，涂炭方始，自策及权，才略足辅，是以尽诚匡弼，以成其业，上籓汉室，下保民物；鼎峙之计，本非其志也。曹公仗顺而起，功以义立，冀以清一诸华，拓平荆郢，大定之机，在於此会。若使昭议获从，则六合为一，岂有兵连祸结，遂为战国之弊哉！虽无功於孙氏，有大当於天下矣。昔窦融归汉，与国升降；张鲁降魏，赏延于世。况权举全吴，望风顺服，宠灵之厚，其可测量哉！然则昭为人谋，岂不忠且正乎！","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018-pei01-02:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018-pei01-02: